=[{"role": "user", "content": `Generate a weekly development summary for the repo ${$json.repo} covering ${$json.weekRange}.

## Stats
- Total Commits: ${$json.stats.totalCommits}
- Closed Issues: ${$json.stats.closedIssues}
- Merged PRs: ${$json.stats.mergedPRs}
- Contributors: ${$json.stats.contributors.length}
- Top Contributor: ${$json.stats.topContributor}

## Commits by Category
**Features (${$json.categorizedCommits.features.length}):** ${$json.categorizedCommits.features.map(c => '- ' + c.commit.message.split('\n')[0]).join('\n') || 'None'}
**Fixes (${$json.categorizedCommits.fixes.length}):** ${$json.categorizedCommits.fixes.map(c => '- ' + c.commit.message.split('\n')[0]).join('\n') || 'None'}
**Documentation (${$json.categorizedCommits.docs.length}):** ${$json.categorizedCommits.docs.map(c => '- ' + c.commit.message.split('\n')[0]).join('\n') || 'None'}

## Recent PRs
${$json.recentPRs.map(pr => `- #${pr.number}: ${pr.title} (${pr.author}, +${pr.additions}/-${pr.deletions} lines)`).join('\n') || 'None'}

## Closed Issues
${$json.recentIssues.map(i => `- #${i.number}: ${i.title} [${i.labels || 'no labels'}]`).join('\n') || 'None'}

Please write a narrative summary (3-5 paragraphs) covering: what was accomplished, notable patterns, areas of focus, and suggestions for next week.`}]

